    </header>
    <body>
        <segment id="1" parent="17" relname="joint">1) The challenge facing World Wildlife Fund is global.</segment>
        <segment id="2" parent="17" relname="joint">2) And time is running out.</segment>
        <segment id="3" parent="16" relname="span">3) We need your member-ship support now.</segment>
        <segment id="4" parent="18" relname="span">4) Extinction can come quickly.</segment>
        <segment id="5" parent="4" relname="interpretation">5) And extinction is forever.</segment>
        <segment id="6" parent="12" relname="span">6) So please consider sending a member-ship contribu-tion of $15, $25, $50. or more if at all possible.</segment>
        <segment id="7" parent="14" relname="span">7) As I said in the beginning of this letter. talk alone won't accomplishmuch.</segment>
        <segment id="8" parent="7" relname="interpretation">8) You and I both know that.</segment>
        <segment id="9" parent="13" relname="span">9) It takes action to get the job done.</segment>
        <segment id="10" parent="19" relname="span">10) I urge you to act today.</segment>
        <group id="11" type="span"/>
        <group id="12" type="span" parent="11" relname="span"/>
        <group id="13" type="span" parent="10" relname="motivation"/>
        <group id="14" type="span" parent="9" relname="volitional-cause"/>
        <group id="15" type="span" parent="6" relname="motivation"/>
        <group id="16" type="span" parent="15" relname="span"/>
